  "version": "1",
  "description": "Desiderata-based masking (Davies et al. 2023, arXiv:2307.03637) over the components of Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct for the MCQA answer letter. scan repeats the component scan of onboarding 09 on the 64 held-out pairs. fit trains one site-grouped gate per attention output and per MLP output of all 28 layers at the answer slot, and apply scores the 56 fitted gates on the held-out pairs. head_fit trains one gate per attention head of layer 22 on attention_premix, and head_apply scores it. Each fit runs at the three l1 weights of onboarding 09: 0.01 as written, 0.3 in the _mid steps and 3.0 in the _hi steps. An apply document selects no bundle entry by an axis, so each weight is its own fit and apply step, and each apply step names the bundles of its own fit. scripts/mcqa_components_dbm/figures.py draws the scan and the masks.",
